# Seed skeleton for this player's home.
#
# Anything under users/<name>/home/ is rsync'd into the stick's LANPARTY_HOME home/
# subdir at flash time (which backs the RAM /home/<user>). Drop dotfiles, saved
# configs, wallpapers, etc. here to pre-seed a player's desktop. Empty is fine - the
# image's first-boot seed guard then populates a fresh home from the baked skeleton.
#
# This .keep exists only so the (otherwise empty) example home/ is tracked in git.
